ing into the dark centre of a galaxy", "slow zoom into a galaxy core"], "opt": "default", "trans": "cut", "move": "push", "rate": 0.032, "dir": 1, "f0": 1857, "f1": 1944, "shot": "esahubble_potw2144a#0", "clip": "esahubble_potw2144a", "ss": 3.79, "crop": null, "score": 0.4074, "ref": "marble_end/3", "title": "Video of Cosmic Fireworks"}, {"sec": "marble_end", "beat": 1, "kind": "clip", "t0": 64.81, "t1": 67.55799999999999, "q": ["zooming into the dark centre of a galaxy", "slow zoom into a galaxy core"], "opt": "default", "trans": "cut", "move": "drift", "rate": 0.032, "dir": 1, "f0": 1944, "f1": 2027, "shot": "esahubble_potm2609b#0", "clip": "esahubble_potm2609b", "ss": 3.38, "crop": null, "score": 0.3925, "ref": "marble_end/4", "title": "Zoom video: NGC 4698"}, {"sec": "marble_end", "beat": 2, "kind": "clip", "t0": 67.55799999999999, "t1": 71.88799999999999, "q": ["close-up of a black hole with a bright ring of light", "black hole bending light around it"], "opt": "default", "trans": "flare", "move": "impact", "rate": 0.12, "f0": 2027, "f1": 2157, "shot": "eso_black-hole-material#0", "clip": "eso_black-hole-material", "ss": 3.44, "crop": null, "score": 0.4314, "ref": "marble_end/5", "title": "Artist's impression of a black hole and the material surrounding it"}], "ovl": [{"kind": "headline", "lines": [{"text": "THE WHOLE EARTH", "t": 5.005}, {"text": "*A MARBLE*", "t": 7.385}], "kicker": null, "sub": null, "pos": "left", "t0": 4.905, "t_last": 7.385, "t1": 9.026000000000002}, {"kind": "num", "t0": 23.93, "t1": 27.43, "num": {"template": "name", "value": "KARL SCHWARZSCHILD", "sub": "German astronomer · 1873-1916", "land_t": 1.3000000000000007, "count_s": 1.1500000000000008, "dur": 3.5}}, {"kind": "headline", "lines": [{"text": "NOTHING ESCAPES", "t": 47.429}, {"text": "*NOT EVEN LIGHT*", "t": 48.486}], "kicker": null, "sub": null, "pos": "left", "t0": 47.329, "t_last": 48.486, "t1": 50.279}, {"kind": "keyline", "t0": 15.632, "t1": 18.232, "text": "DECEMBER 1915"}, {"kind": "keyline", "t0": 30.811, "t1": 33.411, "text": "EINSTEIN'S GENERAL RELATIVITY"}, {"kind": "keyline", "t0": 67.55799999999999, "t1": 69.288, "text": "THE BLACK HOLE"}], "caps": [{"sec": "marble_hook", "t": 0.0, "end": 15.632, "text": "If the whole Earth were squeezed into a black hole, it would be just the size of a marble", "big": false, "t1": 7.0}, {"sec": "marble_hook", "t": 9.066, "end": 15.632, "text": "But this calculation was first made not in a lab, but on a battlefield", "big": false, "t1": 15.632}, {"sec": "marble_war", "t": 15.632, "end": 37.319, "text": "DECEMBER 1915", "big": true, "t1": 18.173}, {"sec": "marble_war", "t": 18.173, "end": 37.319, "text": "During World War One, a German officer was calculating the paths of artillery shells...", "big": false, "t1": 23.93}, {"sec": "marble_war", "t": 23.93, "end": 37.319, "text": "...Karl Schwarzschild", "big": false, "t1": 25.46}, {"sec": "marble_war", "t": 25.46, "end": 37.319, "text": "Amid that same noise and mud of war...", "big": false, "t1": 30.811}, {"sec": "marble_war", "t": 30.811, "end": 37.319, "text": "EINSTEIN'S GENERAL RELATIVITY", "big": true, "t1": 32.204}, {"sec": "marble_war", "t": 32.204, "end": 37.319, "text": "...he found the first exact solution of Einstein's brand-new theory, General Relativity", "big": false, "t1": 35.409}, {"sec": "marble_war", "t": 35.409, "end": 37.319, "text": "Einstein himself was stunned", "big": false, "t1": 37.344500000000004}, {"sec": "marble_limit", "t": 37.344500000000004, "end": 54.471, "text": "But Schwarzschild's calculations hid a strange secret", "big": false, "t1": 42.159}, {"sec": "marble_limit", "t": 42.159, "end": 54.471, "text": "If all of an object's mass is squeezed into a ball smaller than a limit...", "big": false, "t1": 47.429}, {"sec": "marble_limit", "t": 47.429, "end": 54.471, "text": "...not even light can get out", "big": false, "t1": 50.425}, {"sec": "marble_limit", "t": 50.425, "end": 54.471, "text": "For our Sun, that ball would be just 6 km wide", "big": false, "t1": 54.51}, {"sec": "marble_end", "t": 54.51, "end": 68.88799999999999, "text": "Just five months after this calculation, Schwarzschild was dead", "big": false, "t1": 59.841}, {"sec": "marble_end", "t": 59.841, "end": 68.88799999999999, "text": "He never knew he had found the gate to the most dangerous thing in the universe...", "big": false, "t1": 66.84100000000001}, {"sec": "marble_end", "t": 67.55799999999999, "end": 68.88799999999999, "text": "THE BLACK HOLE", "big": true, "t1": 69.18799999999999}], "sfx": [["tick", 4.995, 0], ["tick", 7.375, 0], ["pop", 15.622, 0], ["tick", 15.702, -5], ["pop", 24.05, -2], ["pop", 30.801, 0], ["tick", 30.881, -5], ["tick", 30.951, -5], ["whoosh", 37.1445, -2, {"d": 0.6}], ["tick", 47.419000000000004, 0], ["tick", 48.476, 0], ["whoosh", 49.979000000000006, -4], ["roll", 51.611, 0, {"d": 1.6}], ["hit", 53.201, 0], ["whoosh", 54.309999999999995, -2, {"d": 0.6}], ["riser", 66.358, 0, {"d": 1.2}], ["flare", 67.478, 0], ["pop", 67.54799999999999, 0], ["impact", 67.558, 0], ["tick", 67.62799999999999, -5], ["tick", 67.698, -5]], "mus": [{"kind": "swell", "t0": 66.88000000000001, "peak": 67.558, "t1": 69.358, "db": 7.0}], "music": [{"t": 0.0, "track": "Long_Note_Three.mp3", "gain": 0.0}], "breaths": [[66.58000000000001, 0.3]], "total": 71.88799999999999, "off": 0.5, "grade": {"preset": "amber_teal", "contrast": 0.25, "sat": 1.3, "vignette": 0.35, "grain": 3}, "clips_dir": "/home/user/axiom/work/library/clips"}